start     book
terminals word

# What turns up in the world's chests and the lost library (design §4.2): short, flat, plainly attached, and
# from common words. It stokes curiosity rather than teaching structure, which is the advanced book's job.

# Modifiers lead, the page they modify closes the clause (design §4.3.1): "a desolate Age with packed ice
# landmass, frozen air" rather than "landmass packed_ice".

book = <frozen_age> | <molten_age>

frozen_age = <bleak_mood> age <cold_stone> landmass frozen climate x2
    | age <cold_stone> landmass frozen climate <cold_sky>

molten_age = <bleak_mood> age <hot_stone> landmass molten sea x2
    | age <hot_stone> landmass riddled rock molten sea

bleak_mood = desolate x2 | ancient | foreboding

cold_stone = packed_ice x2 | blue_ice | snow_block

cold_sky = overcast sky | starlit stars

hot_stone = basalt x2 | blackstone | magma_block
